This marker file enables Mavyn's DEMO authentication conveniences
(signed demo tokens, seed logins, Test Center) on dev/preview instances
built from this checkout.

PRODUCTION IS SAFE EVEN WITH THIS FILE PRESENT: on Vercel Production
(VERCEL_ENV=production) demo mode is FORCED OFF in code
(lib/server/auth.ts), production builds SKIP demo seeding
(scripts/seed-unless-production.mjs), and the seed script itself
refuses to run against production. The only override is
MAVYN_FORCE_DEMO_IN_PRODUCTION=1 — never set it on a real deployment.
